    "sections": {
        "description": "Luminex Solar is a modern, lightweight, and fully responsive WordPress block theme designed for solar energy companies, renewable energy providers, solar panel installers, green technology startups, sustainable energy consultants, and eco-friendly businesses. Built with Full Site Editing (FSE) capabilities, the theme allows users to customize every aspect of their website using the WordPress Site Editor without requiring coding knowledge. The theme features professionally designed block patterns, customizable templates, and flexible layouts that help businesses showcase solar panel installations, renewable energy solutions, energy-saving services, project portfolios, customer testimonials, pricing plans, and company information. Its clean and modern design creates a professional online presence while highlighting sustainability and environmental responsibility. Whether you operate a solar power company, renewable energy agency, green technology business, solar installation service, energy consulting firm, or sustainable development organization, Luminex Solar provides all the essential tools needed to build a professional and engaging website."
    },
